\b Product/Service Name:\b0\par
Tutu Fellows Alumni Reunion Retreat \endash  Registration & Contribution\par
\par

\b Category:\b0\par
Events / Nonprofit / Education\par
\par

\b Description:\b0\par
Payment collection for the Tutu Fellows Alumni Reunion Retreat, organised by the African Leadership Institute (AFLI). This event marks the 20th anniversary of the Desmond Tutu Fellowship and the formal launch of the Tutu Fellows Alumni Organisation. The retreat brings together Fellows from across Africa for five days of plenary sessions, focus group working sessions, cultural excursions, and a gala dinner at Victoria Falls, Zimbabwe.\par
\par

\b Payment Components:\b0\par
1. Alumni Organisation Contribution \endash  US$150 flat fee per Fellow, covering alumni organisation setup costs, programmatic expenses, and reunion costs.\par
2. Accommodation \endash  Variable per Fellow based on selected property (Victoria Falls Estates, Zambezi Boutique Lodge, or Vic Falls Safari Lodge), ranging from US$100\endash US$715 per room/night at AFLI-negotiated group rates.\par
\par

\b Payment Tranches:\b0\par
Tranche 1: US$150 deposit at registration \endash  Pay by 30 June 2026\par
Tranche 2: 50% of accommodation cost \endash  Pay by 31 July 2026\par
Tranche 3: Remaining 50% of accommodation cost \endash  Pay by 30 September 2026\par
\par

\b Base Price (enter on PayPal):\b0\par
150.00 USD\par
\par

